How to Build and Run:

Steps (in VS Code terminal):
1. Compile the GaussianBlur server
    g++ GaussianBlur.cpp -o GaussianBlur.exe -lws2_32

2. Compile the calc client
    g++ calc.cpp -o calc.exe -lws2_32

3. Start the blur server
    ./GaussianBlur [n] [c] [bmp]

    For example:
    ./GaussianBlur 1 4 wolf.bmp
    